## EXECUTION

### Pawify app

- /Pawify/dog_function main
dimos ❯ dimos run unitree-go2-relocalization \
              -o relocalizationmodule.map_file=recording_go2

### Map sender position / Interactive map

- create a './send_goal.sh' & put inside:
    #!/usr/bin/env bash
    exec dimos/.venv/bin/python \
        /Pawify/dog_function/send_goal.py "$@"

- Execution: ./send_goal.sh

### DimOs app (to get the info from the robot to the interactive map)

- /Pawify/dog_function main
dimos ❯ dimos run unitree-go2-relocalization \
              -o relocalizationmodule.map_file=recording_go2  # recording_go2 it's the database name of the scanned map

## PRERREQUISTES

Install dimOS from https://github.com/dimensionalOS/dimos

Install at least python 3.12, current python 3.12.13

Have the Apache 2.0 license



